   "/stock/transfer" :Screen Action=transfer "Fail Text"="Could not transfer." Intro="Move stock between two locations in the same city \u2014 a warehouse dispatching to its local retail outlets, for example. Not a sale: no revenue, no customer, just the item's own real Inventory value moving between the two real, location-scoped accounts it sits in, along with the physical stock itself." "Submit Label"=Transfer Template=transaction Title="Stock Transfer"
    - :Field Choices=items Control=choose Empty="Select item\u2026" Label=Item Name=item Reacts=onHand
    - :Field Choices=locations Control=choose Empty="Select location\u2026" Label="From location" Name=fromLocation Reacts=fromLocationChanged
    - :Field Choices=locations Control=choose Empty="Select location\u2026" Filter=sameCityAsFrom Label="To location" Name=toLocation
    - :Field Control=number Label=Quantity Name=quantity Reset=yes
    - :Field Control=text Label=Reference Name=reference Reset=yes
